{
  "title": "Taqibaat of Namaz-e-Fajr",
  "data": "Istighfar before Speaking\nAfter the salam of every prayer, before speaking or doing anything else and without moving from your place, recite:\nاَسْتَغْفِرُ اللهَ الَّذِیْ \nASTAGHFERUL LAAHAL LAZEE \nI seek pardon and protection from Allah Who is \nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا هُوَ الْحَىُّ الْقَيُّوْمُ \nLAA ELAAHA ILLAA HOWAL HAYYUL QAYYOOMO \n“There is no god save He, the Eternal and Self-subsisting, \nذُوْ الْجَلَالِ وَاْلاِكْرَامِ \nZUL JALAALE WAL IKRAAME \nthe Owner of glory and generosity” \nلِجَمِيْعِ ظُلْمِیْ وَجُرْمِیْ وَاِسْرَافِیْ عَلٰی نَفْسِیْ وَاَتُوْبُ اِلَيْهِ.\nLEJAMEE-E’ ZULMEE WA JURMEE WA ISRAAFEE A’LAA NAFSEE WA ATOOBO ELAYHE.\nwith reference to all my injustices, crimes and transgressions which I have committed; and I turn repentant unto Him.",
  "tabs": [
    "Salawat & Tasbih of Lady Fatimah\nRecite:\nرَبِّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَاَهْلِ بَيْتِهٖ.\nRABBE SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AHLE BAYTEHEE.\nO Lord, send blessings on Mohammed and on his Ahlul Bayt.\nThen recite the Tasbih of Lady Fatimah al-Zahra (s.a.), which is recited after every prayer. Recite 34 times:\nاَللهُ اَكْبَرُ\nALLAAHO AKBAR\nAllah is the greatest.\nThen 33 times:\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ\nALHAMDO LIL LAAHE\nPraise be to Allah.\nThen 33 times:\nسُبْحَانَ اللهِ\nSUBHAANAL LAAHE\nGlory be to Allah.\nThen once:\nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ\nLAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO\nThere is no god save Allah.",
    "Subhanallah wal Hamdulillah\nRecite:\nسُبْحَانَ اللهِ وَالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ \nSUBHAANAL LAAHE WAL HAMDO LIL LAAHE \nGlory be to Allah. Praise be to Allah. \nوَلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ وَاللهُ اَكْبَرُ \nWA LAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO WAL LAAHO AKBARO \nThere is no god save Allah. Allah is the greatest. \nوَلَا حَوْلَ وَلَا قُوَّةَ اِلَّا بِاللهِ الْعَلِیِّ الْعَظِيْمِ.\nWA LAA HAWLA WA LAA QUWWATA ILLAA BILLAAHIL A’LIYYIL A’ZEEME.\nThere is no stratagem and no power save with Allah, the Supreme Almighty.",
    "Ma Sha Allah & Ya Fattah ×70\nRecite:\nمَا شَآءَ اللهُ كَانَ وَلَا حَوْلَ وَلَا قُوَّةَ اِلَّا بِاللهِ الْعَلِىِّ الْعَظِيْمِ.\nMAA SHAA ALLAAHO KAANA WA LAA HAWLA WA LAA QUWWATA ILLAA BILLAAHIL A’LEE-IL A’ZEEME.\nThat which Allah wills takes place. There is no stratagem and no power save with Allah, the Supreme Almighty.\nThen recite 70 times, keeping the right hand on the chest:\nيَا فَتَّاحُ\nYA FATTAAHO\nO Opener.",
    "Dua Tawakkaltu ala al-Hayy\nRecite:\nلَا حَوْلَ وَلَا قُوَّةَ اِلَّا بِاللهِ \nLAA HAWLA WA LAA QUWWATA ILLAA BILLAAHE \nThere is no power nor strength (with any) save with Allah. \nتَوَكَلْتُ عَلَی الْحَىِّ الْقَيُّوْمِ الَّذِیْ لَا يَمُوْتُ \nTAWAKKALTO A’LAL HAYY-IL QAYYOOMIL LAZEE LAA YAMOOTO \nI depend upon the everliving self-subsisting (Lord) who does not die. \nوَالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِیْ لَمْ يَتَّخِذْ وَلَدًا \nWAL HAMDO LILLAAHIL LAZEE LAM YATTAKHIZ WALADAN \nPraise be to Allah who has not taken (unto Himself) a son, \nوَّلَمْ يَكُنْ لَّهٗ شَرِيْكٌ فِیْ الْمُلْكِ \nWA LAM YAKUL LAHU SHAREEKUN FIL MULKE \nneither He has any partner in the kingdom, \nوَلَمْ يَكُنْ لَّهٗ وَلِیٌّ مِّنَ الذُّلِّ وَكَبِّرْهُ تَكْبِيْرًا \nWA LAM YAKUL LAHU WALEE-UM MENAZ ZULLE WA KABBIRHO TAKBEERAN \nnor has He any helper out of humility; and proclaim His greatness by extolling (His glory). \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَعُوْذُ بِكَ مِنَ الْبُؤْسِ وَالْفَقْرِ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AO’OZO BEKA MENAL BO’SE WAL FAQRE \nO Allah, verily I take refuge with You from misery and poverty,\nوَمِنْ غَلَبَةِ الدَّيْنِ وَالسُّقْمِ \nWA MIN GHALABATID DAYNE WAS SUQME \nburden of debt and bad health. \nوَاَسْئَلُكَ اَنْ تُعِيْنَنِیْ عَلٰی اَدَآءِ حَقِّكَ اِلَيْكَ وَاِلَی النَّاسِ.\nWA AS-ALOKA AN TO-E’ENANEE A’LAA ADAAE HAQQEKA ELAYKA WA ELAN NAASE.\nI beseech You to please help me in discharging my duties to You and to mankind.",
    "Salawat & Litanies ×100\nAfter the Fajr prayer, recite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nO Allah! Send blessings on Mohammed and the progeny of Mohammed\nوَاهْدِنِیْ لِمَا اخْتُلِفَ فِيْهِ مِنَ الْحَقِّ بِاِذْنِكَ \nWAH-DENEE LEMAKH TOLEFA FEEHE MENAL HAQQE BE-IZNEKA \nand show me the way out of the controversial quarrel unto the truth by Your permission. \nاِنَّكَ تَهْدِیْ مَنْ تَشَآءُ اِلٰی صِرَاطٍ مُّسْتَقِيْمٍ.\nINNAKA TAHDEE MAN TASHAAA-O ELAA SERAATIM MUSTAQEEMIN.\nVerily You guide whomsoever You want unto the right path.\nThen recite 10 times:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMEDIN WA AALE MOHAMMEDENIL \nO Allah! Bless Mohammed and the children of Mohammed,\nاْلَاوْصِيَاءِ الرَّاضِيْنَ الْمَرْضِيِّيْنَ بِاَفْضَلِ صَلَوَاتِكَ \nAWSEYAAA-IR RAAZEENAL MARZIYYEENA BE-AFZALE SALAWAATEKA \nthe pleased and well-pleasing successors, with Your most excellent blessings,\nوَبَارِكْ عَلَيْهِمْ بِاَفْضَلِ بَرَكَاتِكَ \nWA BAARIK A’LAIHIM BE AFZALE BARAKAATEKA \nand endow them with Your excellent endowments, \nوَالسَّلَامُ عَلَيْهِمْ وَعَلٰی اَرْوَاحِهِمْ \nWAS SALAAMO A’LAYHIM WA A’LAA ARWAAHEHIM \nand rest them along with their bodies \nوَاَجْسَادِهِمْ وَرَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ.\nWA AJSAADEHIM WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU.\nand souls in peace and tranquility. Mercy and blessings of Allah be on them.\nThen recite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَحْيِنِىْ عَلٰى مَا اَحْيَيْتَ عَلَيْهِ عَلِىَّ بْنَ اَبِىْ طَالِبٍ \nALLAAHUMMA AHYENEE A’LAA MAA AHYAYTA A’LAYHE A’LIYYABNA ABEE TAALEBIN \nO Allah keep me alive in the same style and manner Ali ibn Abi Talib had lived \nوَاَمِتْنِىْ عَلٰى مَا مَاتَ عَلَيْهِ عَلِىَّ بْنَ اَبِىْ طَالِبٍ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ\nWA AMITNEE A’LAA MAA MAATA A’LAYHE A’LIYYABNA ABEE TAALEBIN A’LAYHIS SALAAMO\nand make me die exactly like Ali Ibn Abi Talib had departed, peace be on him.\nThen recite each of these 100 times:\nاَسْتَغْفِرُ اللهَ وَاَتُوْبُ اِلَيْهِ\nASHTAGHFERUL LAAHA WA ATOOBO ELAYHE.\nI ask forgiveness of Allah and I turn repentant unto Him.\nاَسْئَلُ اللهَ الْعَافِيَةَ\nAS-ALUL LAAHAL A’AFEYATA.\nI beseech Allah for welfare.\nاَسْتَجِيْرُ بِاللهِ مِنَ النَّارِ.\nASTAJEERO BILLAAHE MENAN NAARE.\nI seek refuge with Allah from the fire.\nاَسْئَلُهُ الْجَنَّةَ\nAS-ALOHUL JANNATA.\nI ask Him for the paradise.\nاَسْئَلُ اللهَ الْحُوْرَ الْعِيْنَ\nAS ALUL LAAHAL HOORAL E’ENA\nI invoke Allah for a pious and beautiful spouse.\nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ الْمَلِكُ الْحَقُّ الْمُبِيْنُ\nLAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHUL MALEKUL HAQQUL MUBEENO.\nThere is no god save Allah, the true and evident sovereign.",
    "Dua Ya Malik al-Riqab\nRecite the four Quls ([al-Kafirun](A113), [al-Ikhlas](A116), [al-Falaq](A117), [al-Nas](A118)), then this dua:\nيَا مَالِكَ الرِّقَابِ وَيَا هَازِمَ اْلَاحْزَابِ \nYAA MAALEKAR REQAABE WA YAA HAAZEMAL AHZAABE \nO the master of slaves, O the annihilator of armies, \nيَا مُفَتِّحَ اْلَابْوَابِ يَا مُسَبِّبَ اْلَاسْبَابِ \nYAA MOFATTEHAL ABWAABE YA MOSABBEBAL ASBAABE \nO He who opens the doors (of opportunities), O the causer of causes, \nسَبِّبْ لَنَا... سَبَبًا لَا نَسْتَطِيْعُ لَهٗ طَلَبًا \nSABBIB LANA… (mention desires) SABABAN LAA NASTATEE-O’ LAHU TALABAN \noriginate a basis for us… (mention desires) which we may not make serve us on our own, \nبِحَقِّ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ مُحَمَّدٌ رَسُوْلُ اللهِ\nBEHAQQE LAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO MOHAMMADUR RASOOLUL LAAHE \nfor the sake of - “There is no god save Allah, and Mohammed is His messenger.” – \nصَلَّی اللهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ اَجْمَعِيْنَ.\nSALLAL LAAHO ALAYHE WA AALEHEE AJMA-E’ENA.\nblessings of Allah be on him and on all his children.",
    "Dua Asbahtu Allahumma\nRecite:\nاَصْبَحْتُ اَللّٰهُمَّ مُعْتَصِمًا بِذِمَامِكَ \nASBAHTO ALLAAHUMMA MO’TASEMAN BEZEMAAMEKAL \nI begin the day, O Allah, taking refuge under Your out of reach \nالْمَنِيْعِ الَّذِیْ لَا يُطَاوَلُ وَلَا يُحَاوَلُ \nMANEE-I’L LAZEE LAA YOTAAWALO WALAA YOHAAWALO \nand safe shelter were neither can harass nor ambush (me the evil of) \nمِنْ شَرِّ كُلِّ غَاشِمٍ وَطَارِقٍ \nMIN SHARRE KULLE GHAASHEMIN WA TAAREQIN \nany unjust persecutor or preyful assaulter, \nمِنْ سَآئِرِ مَنْ خَلَقْتَ وَمَا خَلَقْتَ \nMIN SAAA-ERE MAN KHALAQTA WAMAA KHALAQTA \nfrom all whom You have created and all that You have created,\nمِنْ خَلْقِكَ الصَّامِتِ وَالنَّاطِقِ \nMIN KHALQEKAS SAAMETE WAN NAATEQE \namong Your creatures, the silent and the speaking.\nفِیْ جُنَّةٍ مِنْ كُلِّ مَخُوْفٍ بِلِبَاسٍ سَابِغَةٍ \nFEE JUNNATIN MIN KULLE MAKHOOFIN BELEBAASIN SAABEGHATIN \n(I am) in a shield against every feared thing, clad in the ample armour\nوِلآَءِ اَهْلِ بَيْتِ نَبِيِّكَ مُحْتَجِبًا مِنْ كُلِّ قَاصِدٍ لِیْ \nWELAAE AHLE BAYTE NABEEYEKA MOHTAJEBAN MIN KULLE QAASEDIN LEE\nof loyalty to the Ahlul Bayt of Your Prophet, screened from everyone who intends\nاِلٰی اَذِيَّةٍ بِجِدَارٍ حَصِيْنٍ \nELAA AZIYYATIN BEJEDAARIN HASEENENIL \nharm to me, by the fortified wall\nاْلاِخْلَاصِ فِیْ اْلاِعْتِرَافِ \nIKHLAASE FIL E-A’TERAAFE \nof sincerity in acknowledging\nبِحَقِّهِمْ وَالتَّمَسُّكِ بِحَبْلِهِمْ مُوْقِنًا اَنَّ الْحَقَّ لَهُمْ \nBEHAQQEHIM WAT TAMASSOKE BEHABLEHIM MOOQENAN ANNAL HAQQA LAHUM \nand inseparable attachment to their friendship, knowing for certain that truth belongs to them,\nوَمَعَهُمْ وَفِيْهِمْ وَبِهِمْ اُوَالِیْ مَنْ وَالَوْا وَاُجَانِبُ مَنْ جَانَبُوْا \nWA MA-A’HUM WA FEEHIM WA BEHIM OWAALEE MAN WAALAW WA OJAANEBO MAN JAANABOO \n(and that it is) with them, in them and through them. I befriend whoever they befriend and shun whoever they shun;\nفَاَعِذْنِیْ اَللّٰهُمَّ بِهِمْ مِنْ شَرِّ كُلِّ مَا اَتَّقِيْهِ \nFA-AI’ZNEE ALLAAHUMMA BEHIM MIN SHARRE KULLE MAA ATTAQEEHE \nso my Allah keep me safe from every evil that threatens me, \nيَا عَظِيْمُ حَجَزْتُ اْلَاعَادِیَ عَنِّیْ بِبَدِيْعِ السَّمٰوَاتِ وَاْلَارْضِ \nYAA A’ZEEMO HAJAZTUL A-A’AADEYA A’NNEE BEBADEE-I’S SAMAAWAATE WAL A’RZE \nO Almighty! I have barred my enemies from me by the Originator of the heavens and the earth:\nاِنَّا جَعَلْنَا مِنْ بَيْنِ اَيْدِيْهِمْ سَدًّا وَمِنْ خَلْفِهِمْ سَدًّا \nINNAA JA-A’LNAA MIN BAYNE AYDEEHIM SADDAN WA MIN KHALFEHIM SADDAN \n“And We have put before them a barrier and behind them a barrier,\nفَاَغْشَيْنَاهُمْ فَهُمْ لَا يُبْصِرُوْنَ.\nFA- AGHSHAYNAAHUM FAHUM LAA YUBSEROON.\nand We have covered them over, so they do not see.”",
    "Dua for Faith & Well-being\nRecite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ الْاِيْمَانَ بِكَ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKAL EEMAANA BEKA \nO Allah, I beseech You to let me have faith in You, \nوَالتَّصْدِيْقَ بِنَبِيِّكَ \nWAT TASDEEKA BENABIYYEKA \nand acknowledge the truthfulness of Your Prophet; \nوَالْعَافِيَةِ مِنْ جَمِيْعِ الْبَلآَءِ \nWAL A’AAFEYATE MIN JAMEE-I’L BALAAA-E \n(and I beseech You to keep me safe) from all misfortunes; \nوَالشُّكْرَ عَلَی الْعَافِيَةِ \nWASH SHUKRA A’LAL A’AFEYATE \n(and let me) thank You for the welfare, \nوَالْغِنٰی عَنْ شِرَارِ النَّاسِ.\nWAL GHENAA A’N SHERAARIN NAASE.\nand (enable me) to dispense with the evil of the people.",
    "Dua of the Covenant\nRecite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَاطِرَ السَّمٰوَاتِ وَاْلَارْضِ \nALLAHUMMA FAATERAS SAMAAWAATE WAL ARZE \nO Allah! The Creator of the heavens and the earth, \nعَالِمَ الْغَيْبِ وَالشَّهَادَةِ \nA’ALEMAL GHAYBE WASH SHAHADATIR \nknower of the unseen and the seen, \nالرَّحْمٰنَ الرَّحِيْمَ اَعْهَدُ اِلَيْكَ فِی هٰذِهِ الدُّنْيَا \nRAHMAANAR RAHEEMA A-A’HADO ELAYKA FEE HAAZEHID DUNYAA \nthe beneficent, the merciful, I make a covenant in this world \nاَنَّكَ اَنْتَ اللهُ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ \nANNAKA ANTAL LAAHO LAA ELAAHA ILLAA ANTA \nthat verily You are Allah, there is no god save You, \nوَحْدَكَ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَكَ \nWAHDAKA LAA SHAREEKA LAKA \none, there is no associate with You; \nوَاَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا صَلَّی اللهُ عَلَيْهِِ وَاٰلِهٖ \nWA ANNA MOHAMMADAN SALLAL LAAHO ALAYHE WA AALEHI \nand that Mohammed, blessings of Allah be on Him and on his children, \nعَبْدُكَ وَرَسُوْلُكَ \nA’BDOKA WA RASOOLOKA \nis Your servant and messenger. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَصَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA FASALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALEHI \nO Allah send blessings on Mohammed and on his children, \nوَلَا تَكِلْنِىْ اِلٰی نَفْسِیْ طَرْفَةَ عَيْنٍ اَبَدًا \nWA LAA TAKILNEE ELAA NAFSEE TARFATA A’YNIN ABADAN \nand do not ever leave me to follow my nafs (desires) even for a flash of an eye, \nوَلَا اِلٰی اَحَدٍ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ \nWA LAA ELAA AHADIM MIN KHALQEKA \nnor hand over me to any of Your created beings, \nفَاِنَّكَ اِنْ وَكَلْتَنِىْ اِلَيْهَا تُبَاعِدْنِیْ \nFA-INNAKA IN WAKALTANEE ELAYHAA TOBAA-I’DNEE \nbecause if You do so it will bring me \nمِنَ الْخَيْرِ وَتُقَرِّبْنِیْ مِنَ الشَّرِّ \nMENAL KHAYRE WA TOQARRIBNEE MENASH SHARRE \nnear to evil and keep away from good. \nيَا رَبِّ لَا اَثِقُ اِلَّا بِرَحْمَتِكَ \nYAA RABBE LAA ASEQO ILLAA BERAHMATEKA \nO Lord! I do not put trust in anything save Your mercy. \nفَصَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهِ الطَّيِّبِيْنَ \nFASALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALEHIT TAYYEBEENA \nThen send blessings upon Muhammad and his pure progeny\nوَاجْعَلْ لِیْ عِنْدَكَ عَهْدًا تُؤَدِيْهِ اِلَیَّ يَوْمَ الْقِيٰمَةِ \nWAJ A’L LEE I’NDAKA A’HDAN TO-ADEEHE ELAYYA YAWMAL QEYAAMATE \nand make for me with You a covenant that You will fulfil for me on the Day of Resurrection.\nاِنَّكَ لَا تُخْلِفُ الْمِيْعَادَ.\nINNAKA LAA TUKHLEFUL MEE-A’ADA.\nVerily You do not break promise.",
    "Forgiveness for Believers ×25\nRecite 25 times:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اغْفِرْ لِلْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ وَالْمُسْلِمِيْنَ وَالْمُسْلِمَاتِ.\nALLAAHUM MAGHFIR LIL-MOAMENEENA WAL MOAMENAATE WAL MUSLEMEENA WAL MUSLEMAATE.\nO Allah, forgive all believing men and believing women, and all Muslim men and Muslim women.",
    "Dua for Light, Insight & Certainty\nRecite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِحَقِّ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ عَلَيْكَ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BEHAQQE MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN A’LAYKA \nO Allah! I beseech You in the name of the rights, Mohammed and his children have with You, \nصَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nSALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nto send blessings on Mohammed and on the children of Mohammed \nوَاجْعَلِ النُّوْرَ فِیْ بَصَرِیْ وَالْبَصِيْرَةَ فِیْ دِيْنِیْ \nWAJ A’LIN NOORA FEE BASAREE WAL BASEERATA FEE DEENEE \nand let me see and recognize (the truth), (let me) have deep insight of my religion, \nوَالْيَقِيْنَ فِیْ قَلْبِیْ وَاْلاِخْلَاصَ فِیْ عَمَلِیْ \nWAL YAQEENA FEE QALBEE WAL IKHLAASA FEE A’MALAEE \ncertainty in my heart, sincerity in my deeds, \nوَالسَّلَامَةَ فِیْ نَفْسِیْ وَالسَّعَةَ فِیْ رِزْقِیْ \nWAS SALAAMATA FEE NAFSEE WAS SA-A’TA FEE RIZQEE \nwell-being of myself, enough livelihood, \nوَالشُّكْرَ لَكَ اَبَدًا مَّا اَبْقَيْتَنِیْ.\nWASH SHUKRA LAKA ABADAM MAA ABQAYTANEE.\nand let me thank You always till the end of my life.",
    "Dua La Ilaha Illallah al-Jalil\nAfter the Fajr prayer, recite this dua. It may also be kept on the body as a ta’weez.\nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ الْجَلِيْلُ الْجَبَّارُ \nLAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHUL JALEELUL JABBAARO \nThere is no god save Allah, the Glorious, the Supreme. \nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ الْعَزِيْزُ الْغَفَّارُ \nLAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHUL A’ZEEZUL GHAFFAARO \nThere is no god save Allah, the Mighty, the Oft-forgiving. \nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ الْوَاحِدُ الْقَهَّارُ \nLAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHUL WAAHEDUL QAHHAARO \nThere is no god save Allah, the One, the Dominating. \nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ وَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ \nLAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO WAHDAHU LAA SHAREEKA LAHU \nThere is no god save Allah, the Single Who has no associate, \nاِلٰهًا وَّاحِدًا وَّنَحْنُ لَهٗ مُسْلِمُوْنَ \nELAAHAN WAAHEDAN WA NAHNO LAHU MUSLEMOONA \nthe only God, we surrender ourselves to His will. \nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ وَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ \nLAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO WAHDAHU LAA SHAREEKA LAHU \nThere is no god save Allah, the Single, Who has no associate, \nاِلٰهًا وَّاحِدًا وَنَحْنُ لَهٗ مُخْلِصُوْنَ \nELAAHAN WAAHEDAN WA NAHNO LAHU MUKHLESOONA \nand to Him we are sincere. \nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ وَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ \nLAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO WAHDAHU LAA SHAREEKA LAHU \nThere is no god save Allah, \nاِلٰهًا وَّاحِدًا وَّنَحْنُ لَهٗ عَابِدُوْنَ \nELAAHAN WAAHEDAN WA NAHNO LAHU A’ABEDOONA \nthe Single, Who has no associate, and we worship Him. \nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ مُحَمَّدٌ رَّسُوْلُ اللهِ \nLAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO MOHAMMADUR RASOOLUL LAAHE \nThere is no god save Allah, Mohammed is the messenger of Allah, \nعَلِیٌّ وَلِیُّ اللهِ وَصَلَّی اللهُ عَلٰی خَيْرِ خَلْقِهٖ\nA’LIYYUN WALIYYUL LAAHE WA SALLAL LAAHO A’LAA KHAYRE KHALQEHI \nAli is the vicegerent of Allah. Blessings of Allah be on His best creation, \nوَمَظْهَرِ لُطْفِهٖ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِهٖ  اَجْمَعِيْنَ \nWA MAZHARE LUTFEHI MOHAMMADIN WA AALEHI AJMA-E’ENAT \nthe manifestation of His pleasure, Mohammed, and all his pure, \nالطَّيِّبِيْنَ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ بِرَحْمَتِكَ يَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ \nTAYYEBEENAT TAAHEREENA BERAHMATEKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEEN \npious and clean children, on account of Your mercy, O the most merciful. \nحَسْبُنَا اللهُ وَنِعْمَ الْوَكِيْلُ نِعْمَ الْمَوْلٰی وَنِعْمَ النَّصِيْرُ.\nHASBONAL LAAHO WA NE’MAL WAKEELO NE’MAL MAWLAA WA NE’MAN NASEERO.\nAllah is sufficient for us, He is the best supporter, the best master, the best helper.",
    "Surahs al-Qadr, Ya-Sin & al-Ikhlas\nThen recite [Surah al-Qadr](A101) 10 times.\nRecite [Surah Ya-Sin](A40).\nRecite [Surah al-Ikhlas](A116) 100 times."
